<title>THAILAND: PTT Exploration plans $200 mln debenture.</title>
<headline>PTT Exploration plans $200 mln debenture.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's PTT Exploration and Production Plc said on Wednesday the company would seek shareholder approval to issue unsecured debentures worth up to $200 million in foreign markets.</p>
<p>The debentures would have maturity of no more than 30 years, PTT Exploration said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand. Other details and conditions of the issue would be considered by the managing director, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
